VioletCity_Text_OldMan1::
	.string "FALKNER, from the VIOLET POKéMON\n"
	.string "GYM, is a fine trainer!\p"
	.string "He inherited his father’s gym and\n"
	.string "has done a great job with it.$"

VioletCity_Text_Beauty::
	.string "Ghosts are rumored to appear in\n"
	.string "SPROUT TOWER.\p"
	.string "They said normal type POKéMON\n"
	.string "moves had no effect on ghosts.$"

VioletCity_Text_FatMan_1::
	.string "Hello!\n"
	.string "You are trainer?$"

VioletCity_Text_FatMan_2::
	.string "Battle GYM LEADER, win you did?$"

VioletCity_Text_FatMan_3::
	.string "Is that so? Then study shall you!\n"
	.string "Follow me!$"

VioletCity_Text_FatMan_4::
	.string "Here, teacher I am. Good it is\n"
	.string "you study here!$"

VioletCity_Text_FatMan_5::
	.string "Ooh, la la!\n"
	.string "Very indeed nice!$"

VioletCity_Text_Youngster::
	.string "I saw a wiggly tree up ahead!\p"
	.string "If you touch it, it squirms and\n"
	.string "dances, Cool!$"

VioletCity_Text_Boy::
	.string "Hey, you’re a POKéMON trainer?\p"
	.string "If you beat the GYM LEADER here,\n"
	.string "you’ll be ready for prime time!$"

VioletCity_Text_WorkerF_1::
	.string "MONICA: Glad to meet you. I’m\n"
	.string "MONICA of Monday.\p"
	.string "As a token of our friendship, I have\n"
	.string "a gift for you!$"

VioletCity_Text_WorkerF_2::
	.string "MONICA: It’s an item that raises\n"
	.string "the power of flying-type moves.\p"
	.string "You should equip a bird POKéMON with\n"
	.string "that item.$"

VioletCity_Text_WorkerF_3::
	.string "MONICA: My brothers and sisters\n"
	.string "are all over the place.\p"
	.string "See if you could find them all!$"

VioletCity_Text_Trigger2::
	.string "PROF.ELM: Hello, {PLAYER}?\n"
	.string "We discovered something about\l"
	.string "the EGG!\p"
	.string "My assistant is at the POKéMON\n"
	.string "CENTER in VIOLET CITY.\l"
	.string "Could you talk to him?\p"
	.string "END OF MESSAGE.$"

